WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.782 --> 00:00:03.032
(clanging)

00:00:03.490 --> 00:00:04.948
(laughing)

00:00:04.948 --> 00:00:05.781
- [Inga] Watch

00:00:05.781 --> 00:00:06.614
- It's about 30 minutes now...

00:00:06.614 --> 00:00:07.572
(clanging)

00:00:07.572 --> 00:00:09.168
Never mind, don't watch.

00:00:09.168 --> 00:00:11.168
(music)

00:00:12.936 --> 00:00:16.209
- [Inga] We are here at Benihana,
I am here with chef Devin.

00:00:16.209 --> 00:00:18.792
He is a master Teppanyaki chef.

00:00:18.840 --> 00:00:22.645
He's going to teach me how
to become a true master chef.

00:00:22.645 --> 00:00:24.035
- [Devin] First things first,
you want to put on your

00:00:24.035 --> 00:00:26.384
uniform, your apron, your chef hat.

00:00:26.384 --> 00:00:28.384
(music)

00:00:34.688 --> 00:00:37.021
- [Inga] I'm official. Ha...

00:00:37.801 --> 00:00:38.634
(Inga laughs)

00:00:38.634 --> 00:00:40.112
This is how we're gonna do it.

00:00:40.112 --> 00:00:41.473
I'm going to start by
practicing some tricks.

00:00:41.473 --> 00:00:42.939
Then I'll put my skills to the test.

00:00:42.939 --> 00:00:45.522
And finally be judged on how I perform.

00:00:45.522 --> 00:00:47.577
(clanging)

00:00:47.577 --> 00:00:48.842
(drumming)

00:00:48.842 --> 00:00:50.040
- [Devin] So I'm going
to show you some tricks.

00:00:50.040 --> 00:00:51.912
You want to try flipping this spatula.

00:00:51.912 --> 00:00:52.745
- [Inga] Is this sharp?

00:00:52.745 --> 00:00:54.473
- [Devin] A little bit.

00:00:54.473 --> 00:00:56.973
(cirus music)

00:00:58.845 --> 00:01:03.762
- [Devin] There we go. (celebration music)

00:01:04.212 --> 00:01:07.606
The trick is just moving
your whole arm in a circle.

00:01:07.606 --> 00:01:09.856
(clanging)

00:01:12.976 --> 00:01:14.632
(celebration music)

00:01:14.632 --> 00:01:16.882
(clanging)

00:01:20.850 --> 00:01:23.433
(egg sizzling)

00:01:30.150 --> 00:01:32.067
- [Inga] Let's move on.

00:01:33.275 --> 00:01:35.481
(shrimp sizzling)

00:01:35.481 --> 00:01:36.610
(celebration music)

00:01:36.610 --> 00:01:38.693
- [Inga] Hey! Ha ha ha...

00:01:39.083 --> 00:01:40.041
(upbeat music)

00:01:40.041 --> 00:01:42.997
Oh no, watch me hit my face with shrimp.

00:01:42.997 --> 00:01:45.580
(shrimp splat)

00:01:49.676 --> 00:01:50.509
I got it!

00:01:50.509 --> 00:01:51.620
- [Devin] You got it!

00:01:51.620 --> 00:01:52.589
- [Inga] Yay!

00:01:52.589 --> 00:01:55.089
(Inga laughs)

00:01:55.469 --> 00:01:58.219
(water sizzling)

00:01:58.427 --> 00:01:59.260
- [Devin] You want to see the butterfly?

00:01:59.260 --> 00:02:01.927
- [Inga] No, what's a butterfly?

00:02:02.093 --> 00:02:03.984
- [Devin] Soy sauce, a little sodium

00:02:03.984 --> 00:02:05.984
and you got high sodium.

00:02:07.073 --> 00:02:09.290
- [Inga] Is Benihana known for dad jokes?

00:02:09.290 --> 00:02:10.651
- [Devin] Show you how
to make a beating heart.

00:02:10.651 --> 00:02:12.984
(heartbeat)

00:02:13.519 --> 00:02:14.718
So now you have to do it...

00:02:14.718 --> 00:02:15.926
- [Inga] In front of people, my friends...

00:02:15.926 --> 00:02:18.926
- [Devin] Yeah, don't count anybody.

00:02:19.072 --> 00:02:22.072
(rhythmic clapping)

00:02:22.329 --> 00:02:25.079
(drumming music)

00:02:33.064 --> 00:02:34.917
- [Inga] I welcome you all
to this journey of mine,

00:02:34.917 --> 00:02:37.456
on becoming a master Teppanyaki Chef.

00:02:37.456 --> 00:02:41.456
I hope you're ready for
an epic Teppanyaki meal.

00:02:43.468 --> 00:02:45.258
Let's do this... What am I doing?

00:02:45.258 --> 00:02:47.508
(clanging)

00:02:50.001 --> 00:02:53.334
Like that? Cut this out, cut this out...

00:02:54.062 --> 00:02:56.729
(bells ringing)

00:03:09.126 --> 00:03:12.709
And... (tapping) Choo Choo

00:03:14.476 --> 00:03:16.726
(laughing)

00:03:17.427 --> 00:03:20.228
Let me show you a magic
trick, you see this butter?

00:03:20.228 --> 00:03:23.311
It's going to become a butter... fly.

00:03:23.378 --> 00:03:25.125
(laughing)

00:03:25.125 --> 00:03:27.375
(drumming)

00:03:30.588 --> 00:03:31.664
Please enjoy.

00:03:31.664 --> 00:03:32.497
(Nnenna Mmm)

00:03:32.497 --> 00:03:33.368
- [Chris] Super good!

00:03:33.368 --> 00:03:34.916
- [Nnenna] I'm serious,
I've never had vegetable

00:03:34.916 --> 00:03:36.583
that tasted so good.

00:03:36.824 --> 00:03:38.290
- [Skyler] Just a little bit oily.

00:03:38.290 --> 00:03:40.207
(whoa)

00:03:44.911 --> 00:03:48.069
- [Inga] I'm going to pull a Lebron James.

00:03:48.069 --> 00:03:50.596
(applause) Oh, I got it on the first shot!

00:03:50.596 --> 00:03:51.429
Oh my God!

00:03:52.905 --> 00:03:55.155
(applause)

00:03:57.074 --> 00:04:00.438
I've never been so glad to
have shrimp tails in my head.

00:04:00.438 --> 00:04:03.525
- [Nnenna] This has been
amazing, I'm just thrilled.

00:04:03.525 --> 00:04:07.000
- [Inga] Can't wait for them
to see my egg roll trick.

00:04:07.000 --> 00:04:08.825
This is what dreams are made
of, this is my childhood.

00:04:08.825 --> 00:04:09.658
- [Skyler] It's my childhood.

00:04:09.658 --> 00:04:10.719
- [Inga] Your childhood is my childhood,

00:04:10.719 --> 00:04:11.681
what are you talking about?

00:04:11.681 --> 00:04:12.993
- [Skyler] I ate more rice than you.

00:04:12.993 --> 00:04:14.027
- [Chris] Uh oh... Rice-off!

00:04:14.027 --> 00:04:17.088
- [Inga] This is my favorite
trick yet. Here's an egg.

00:04:17.088 --> 00:04:18.131
I'm going to perform some magic

00:04:18.131 --> 00:04:19.502
and make it into an egg roll.

00:04:19.502 --> 00:04:20.335
- [Chris] Don't do this...

00:04:20.335 --> 00:04:21.585
- [Inga] Ready?

00:04:22.248 --> 00:04:23.081
- [Skyler] Wow.

00:04:23.081 --> 00:04:23.914
- [Inga] Egg roll.

00:04:23.914 --> 00:04:28.497
- [Chris] I don't want to
give that a clap, that was...

00:04:30.388 --> 00:04:31.791
- [Inga] Do you know why
I'm making an omelet?

00:04:31.791 --> 00:04:33.041
- [Nnenna] Why?

00:04:33.052 --> 00:04:34.802
- [Inga] Cuz I'm lit.

00:04:37.727 --> 00:04:39.977
(laughter)

00:04:43.242 --> 00:04:46.575
- [Chris] She is very good at seasoning.

00:04:49.002 --> 00:04:51.335
(heartbeat)

00:04:57.016 --> 00:04:58.049
(clanging)

00:04:58.049 --> 00:04:59.752
He makes way more noise than you do.

00:04:59.752 --> 00:05:02.002
(clanging)

00:05:08.044 --> 00:05:09.425
- [Inga] That's it guys.

00:05:09.425 --> 00:05:10.258
(clapping)

00:05:10.258 --> 00:05:13.182
The course is complete, now
it's time for the real test.

00:05:13.182 --> 00:05:15.247
- [Chris] A lot of good
jokes, a lot of good tricks.

00:05:15.247 --> 00:05:17.895
I'm going to give this
a massive thumbs up.

00:05:17.895 --> 00:05:19.539
- [Nnenna] The shrimp was
succulent, the mushroom was

00:05:19.539 --> 00:05:22.457
magnificent, the rice was just whoa.

00:05:22.457 --> 00:05:24.159
Inga, you were crazy, you were hilarious.

00:05:24.159 --> 00:05:25.576
So I give it a...

00:05:26.982 --> 00:05:30.732
- [Inga] So my final
judge, my worst enemy...

00:05:30.763 --> 00:05:33.068
- [Skyler] As much as
I hate to admit it...

00:05:33.068 --> 00:05:35.235
She did a great job. So...

00:05:36.874 --> 00:05:38.225
(celebration music)

00:05:38.225 --> 00:05:39.058
- [Inga] Did I make mom proud?

00:05:39.058 --> 00:05:42.162
- [Skyler] Ha ha, no...
She's still better.

00:05:42.162 --> 00:05:43.179
(laughter)

00:05:43.179 --> 00:05:45.341
- [Devin] You've past the test
and I now present you with

00:05:45.341 --> 00:05:49.841
this certificate and I dub
you master Teppanyaki Chef.

00:05:50.515 --> 00:05:51.542
- [Inga] Thank you for
everything you taught me.

00:05:51.542 --> 00:05:53.557
I will hold this title with pride

00:05:53.557 --> 00:05:56.974
and I will do the Teppanyaki world proud.

00:06:08.894 --> 00:06:10.459
- Hey, Unsolved is on a new
channel and now your part...

00:06:10.459 --> 00:06:13.376
- Subscribe here, that was my part.

